        Note above that the 2 "clearing lines" (immediately following 
"ENDANSI") serve two purposes here. The first line clears all of the pass 
indictors and the second line changes the highlight from "Main" to 
"Imbedded".
        Remember that the "fail" indicators need not be cleared as they
will only be filled by a process which caused the testing to be aborted.
        The purpose of the other lines is stated in the THDFILES.TXT
document. Feel free to edit any of the ansi screens supplied as they are 
only meant as a guide for those who might wish to create their own ansi 
screen interface.
